<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Feb 25.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Feb 25.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to East Anglia Feb 112.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to West Norfolk Mar 97.00 Apr 98.50/99.00</p>
<p>Lancashire Apr 99.00 Apr/Jun 101.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Mar 98.00</p>
<p>Suffolk Apr/May 99.75</p>
<p>Feed barley no trade reported</p>
</text>
